Well it seems that some of the old abuses in Nethack have been taken
away in Nethack++!

Kicking a sink does nothing.

But the coolest new thing is that the shopkeeper notices if you kick
items out of the store!

However, there are NEW abuses you can try:
--- SPOILERS ---

I started as a wizard and had a spellbook of create monster in my
inventory when I started.  Later, I found a neutral altar to Thoth (Yay!).
So, I figured I'd get a few free sacrifices by creating some monsters
in the room to kill.

What I found out was that spells are much more powerful in Nethack++!
I cast that create monster spell over and over and over, but it never
got over-used.  By the time I was done, I had Giantslayer, Dragonsbane,
Frost Brand, and Fire Brand.  Only problem was, my poor wizard had a
strength of 8 and couldn't carry all of those macho weapons.  So I
left them in a chest and carried frost brand down into the lower dungeons.
And wouldn't you know it, there has to be a David's Zoo with a bunch
of ice trolls and elf lords to ruin your day.  *SIGH*  

The trick in nethack, as in life, is in learning how NOT to die.  So
far, i've been completely unsuccessful in nethack...

